**TrustStats**: marginTop 64, paddingTop 28, borderTop BRAND.border, grid 4-col gap 32, className `v4-hero-trust`. Each item: stat (18px weight 600 onyx, marginBottom 4) + label (13px stone).

**Centered variant**: same as default but `alignItems: center` and `textAlign: center` on container.

**Dark variant**: BRAND.onyx bg, MangomintBlobs cta variant, 2 rust glow atmospheres (top-left and bottom-right), centered layout. Headline becomes BRAND.bone color. italicWord becomes BRAND.rustBright. Subhead becomes BRAND.stoneLight. Primary CTA flips: bone bg + onyx text. Secondary CTA: bordered with `BRAND.borderInk`, transparent bg, BRAND.stoneLight text.

Use motion: initial fadeUp opacity:0, y:8/16/24 cascading delays for eyebrow/headline/subhead/CTAs (durations 0.6/0.8/0.7/0.6, delays 0/0/0.15/0.3).

