Logic:
1. const pathname = usePathname()
2. const segments = pathname.split('/').filter(Boolean)
3. If segments.length === 0, return null
4. Build crumbs: `[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }]` + each segment with cumulative href
5. Label resolution: labelMap?.[segment] ?? slugToTitle(segment)
6. slugToTitle: replace '-' with space, capitalise each word

Render: container maxWidth 1280, padding 14px 32px, flex alignItems center gap 6. Each crumb: link (12px FONT.sans BRAND.stone) except last (BRAND.stoneDark, no link). ChevronRight 12 BRAND.stoneLight as separator between.

